+ * title double-buffers on -- when flip N is done, the RSX has finished frame
+ * N, so frame N's buffers may be rewritten. Completing on the tick alone let
+ * J-Stars run ahead of the drawing thread once the tick stopped waiting for
+ * the drain: HUD drawn as black boxes, broken city geometry (jstars-notes
+ * CPU_PROFILE §40). The frame clock reports s_flip_request_count after each
+ * present (every queued flip decoded so far has been shown by then). Like
+ * GCM_FLIP_AT_WORD, flips owed for PRESENT_GATE_MS (default 100) are
+ * released, so a flip that is never drawn cannot stop the title for good.
